  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/02/FiraVehicleSeminouCitroen-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(24 fotos) Este martes ha comenzado en Talleres Elios S&aacute;nchez de Onda la Feria del Autom&oacute;vil seminuevo Citro&euml;n, que se desarrollar&aacute; en sus instalaciones de la avenida Mediterr&aacute;neo, 3 hasta el s&aacute;bado 16 de febrero a las 14 horas. All&iacute; se pueden eoncontrar veh&iacute;culos de todas clases con condiciones muy ventajosas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firavehicleseminoucitroen/firavehicleseminoucitroen-1.jpg\" alt=\"firavehicleseminoucitroen-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firavehicleseminoucitroen/firavehicleseminoucitroen-2.jpg\" alt=\"firavehicleseminoucitroen-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firavehicleseminoucitroen/img_9962.jpg\" alt=\"img_9962\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firavehicleseminoucitroen/img_9964.jpg\" alt=\"img_9964\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firavehicleseminoucitroen/img_9967.jpg\" alt=\"img_9967\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firavehicleseminoucitroen/img_9968.jpg\" alt=\"img_9968\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firavehicleseminoucitroen/img_9969.jpg\" alt=\"img_9969\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firavehicleseminoucitroen/img_9972.jpg\" alt=\"img_9972\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;